":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p025","quote":"趙悼襄王元年，廉頗既亡入魏，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。居二年，龐暖破燕軍，殺劇辛。後七年，秦破殺趙將扈輒於武遂，斬首十萬。趙乃以李牧爲大將軍，撃秦軍於宜安，大破秦軍，走秦將桓齮。封李牧爲武安君。居三年，秦攻番吾，李牧撃破秦軍，南距韓、魏。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名、國別君序與代將敘事暫接；李牧牧在明示北邊主題內同指，趙王遷王稱限定末次代將。北邊早年趙王、他人及單于未名分存，不強接悼襄；太史公讓頗承接廉藺敘事，其他引語指代待逐處覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p025","text":"趙悼襄王元年，廉頗既亡入魏，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。居二年，龐暖破燕軍，殺劇辛。後七年，秦破殺趙將扈輒於武遂，斬首十萬。趙乃以李牧爲大將軍，撃秦軍於宜安，大破秦軍，走秦將桓齮。封李牧爲武安君。居三年，秦攻番吾，李牧撃破秦軍，南距韓、魏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"趙悼襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"qbg_2pe_t58","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"龐暖","kind":"person","person_id":"0p4_ef2_1xa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"劇辛","kind":"person","person_id":"bkf_68m_hxl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0049","start":49,"end":53,"surface":"趙將扈輒","kind":"person","person_id":"vo2_2ho_kyz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"qbg_2pe_t58","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0085","start":85,"end":89,"surface":"秦將桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"1cl_1rg_gk9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"qbg_2pe_t58","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m025-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"李牧","kin